  "name": "Couscous",
  "text": "Couscous\n\nPreparation time: None\n\nCooking time: 10 minutes\n\nYield: 4 servings\n\nIngredients\n\n1 cup couscous,\n\n1 cup hot water,\n\na knob of butter,\n\nsalt & pepper.\n\nOptional Ingredients\n\nChives (chopped),\n\nred pepper (diced).\n\nPreparation\n\n1. Put the couscous in a pyrex bowl.\n\n2. Boil the water and pour over the couscous.\n\n3. Cover with cling film and wait for 10 minutes.\n\n4. Remove the cling film and fluff with a fork.\n\n5. Add a knob of butter and season.\n\n6. If required add the optional ingredients.",
  "prepTime": "PT0M",
  "cookTime": "PT10M",
